sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>ASGI
    participant Quota as QuotaMiddleware<br/>ASGI
    participant ABAC as Access Control Engine<br/>Cedar ABAC
    participant Router as Routing Engine<br/>Resource → Provider
    participant Provider as Provider<br/>(inline or remote)
    participant JWKS as OAuth2/JWKS Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KVStore as KV Store<br/>(SQLite/Redis)
    participant LLM as External LLM API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Tools as Tool Runtime<br/>(MCP/Search/etc.)
    participant Safety as Safety Provider<br/>(Shield)
    participant VectorIO as Vector IO Provider<br/>(pgvector/FAISS/etc.)

    Note over Client, LLM: Flow 1: Chat Completion Request

    Client->>+Auth: POST /v1/inference/chat-completion<br/>8321/TCP HTTP/HTTPS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Auth->>JWKS: Validate JWT (fetch JWKS keys)<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    JWKS-->>Auth: Public keys / validation result
    Auth->>+Quota: Forward (authenticated request)
    Quota->>KVStore: Check client quota<br/>(SQLite local / Redis 6379/TCP)
    KVStore-->>Quota: Quota status (under limit)
    Quota->>+ABAC: Forward (within quota)
    ABAC->>ABAC: Evaluate ABAC policy<br/>(principal, resource, attributes)
    ABAC->>+Router: Forward (authorized)
    Router->>Router: Lookup provider for model
    Router->>+Provider: Delegate to backing provider
    Provider->>+LLM: POST /chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (API key)
    LLM-->>-Provider: Streaming response chunks
    Provider-->>-Router: SSE stream
    Router-->>-ABAC: Pass through
    ABAC-->>-Quota: Pass through
    Quota-->>-Auth: Pass through
    Auth-->>-Client: SSE stream<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8321/TCP

    Note over Client, VectorIO: Flow 2: Agent Turn with Tool Use

    Client->>+Auth: POST /v1/agents/{id}/session/{sid}/turn<br/>8321/TCP HTTP/HTTPS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Auth->>Auth: Validate Bearer Token
    Auth->>+Router: Forward (authenticated)

    loop Agent Execution Loop
        Router->>+Provider: InferenceStep → call LLM
        Provider->>+LLM: Chat completion request<br/>HTTPS/443
        LLM-->>-Provider: Response (with tool_calls)
        Provider-->>-Router: Tool call requested

        Router->>+Safety: ShieldCallStep → check content<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
        Safety-->>-Router: Content approved

        Router->>+Tools: ToolExecutionStep → invoke tool<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (MCP/Search/etc.)
        Tools-->>-Router: Tool result

        Router->>+VectorIO: MemoryRetrievalStep → RAG query<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
        VectorIO-->>-Router: Retrieved context

        Router->>+Provider: InferenceStep → call LLM with context
        Provider->>+LLM: Chat completion (with tool results + context)
        LLM-->>-Provider: Final response
        Provider-->>-Router: Completion
    end

    Router-->>-Auth: SSE stream events
    Auth-->>-Client: Streaming SSE events<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8321/TCP
